r  isil if we don't deal with this  in a in a very smart way and all  potentially exacerbated by other events  in syria like the  withdrawal of u.s forces absolutely uh  and also i mean don't forget that uh  if you have the regime the syrian regime  taking control back of most of these  territories without changing the  approach  which in the first place have led in the  first place have led to the rise of isil  i think that  resentment will remain there and  resentment is  in my opinion the major issue that we  have to deal with here  if we want to uh eliminate isil  completely on the ideological level  marwan kabul and thank you for now we'll  talk to you again later on hopefully as  we get some more information  on this story thank you

